WEBVTT

1
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,690
What if a technology boss saw his daughter eating wild vegetables and sleeping in a tree?

2
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:19,890
I won’t call her Miss anymore

3
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,490
I also had steak tonight

4
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,090
The emperor's food is better than hers

5
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:24,490
If we want to talk about delicious food, we have to reduce it.

6
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:25,890
What they eat is roasted new lean meat

7
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:27,490
The smell of barbecue attracted everyone

8
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:28,890
She won't want to sleep tonight

9
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,090
The prince wants to pick the soft side

10
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,490
Just came from another team's live broadcast room

11
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:32,690
They have set their goals

12
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:33,690
We must first capture Wang Tianwei

13
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,610
One sprint is not fast enough
